### URL Shortener API Tests

# Test 1: Shorten a URL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.google.com"
}

###

# Test 2: Shorten another URL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "https://www.github.com"
}

###

# Test 3: Get URL stats (replace 'abc123' with actual short code from above)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats/abc123

###

# Test 4: Test redirection (replace 'abc123' with actual short code)
GET http://localhost:8080/abc123

###

# Test 5: Test invalid URL
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "invalid-url"
}

###

# Test 6: Test empty request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": ""
}
